WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:43.119 --> 00:00:45.720
In these mountains,
live the strange people.

00:00:46.319 --> 00:00:50.479
They have been protected and isolated
from the rest of the world for centuries.

00:00:54.119 --> 00:00:57.119
Grand Dragon is their medicine man,
their seer.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:00:59.880
He knows all and he spoke to us.

00:01:00.959 --> 00:01:03.840
Two thousand years ago,
two tribes arrived here.

00:01:03.919 --> 00:01:07.239
They were the Yi
who were fleeing the Sichuan province

00:01:07.319 --> 00:01:09.279
and the Hani from Tibet.

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:12.879
Defying the steep slopes with buffaloes,

00:01:12.959 --> 00:01:17.519
they worked the mountains
and invented the irrigated rice terrace.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:30.839
The Chinese emperor rewarded them
and baptized them The Mountain Sculptors.

00:01:32.639 --> 00:01:35.639
[Hani spoken audio]

00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:48.400
So that everyone has a rice paddy,

00:01:48.519 --> 00:01:52.160
the Hani and the Yi
sculpt their mountains each year.

00:01:53.239 --> 00:01:54.559
However, to change the land,

00:01:54.639 --> 00:01:57.199
they need the approval
of the natural forces.

00:01:58.120 --> 00:02:02.040
Therefore, they appeal to Grand Dragon
for he alone has the power

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:05.360
to question the wind,
the rain and the seasons,

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.240
and to choose the best time
to sculpt the new mountain.

00:02:10.279 --> 00:02:13.279
[Hani spoken audio].

00:02:47.399 --> 00:02:50.759
Twenty centuries were required
to shape this land.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:53.360
The people here like to admire it.

00:02:53.919 --> 00:02:56.720
Their past is engraved in these mountains.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:12.960
This tremendous work
would never have been possible

00:03:13.039 --> 00:03:14.839
without the help of the buffalo.

00:03:19.039 --> 00:03:23.960
To work the land and move boulders
for growing rice and for carrying men,

00:03:24.039 --> 00:03:26.279
the buffalo has always been there,

00:03:27.119 --> 00:03:31.559
as strong as a mountain
and as serene as a rice paddies water.

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:40.119
Every man is connected
to a buffalo for life.

00:03:40.399 --> 00:03:43.759
When he dies,
his buffalo is buried with him.

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:49.399
Grand Dragon's buffalo
is called Immense Knowledge.

00:03:49.839 --> 00:03:51.919
You never see the one without the other,

00:03:52.479 --> 00:03:55.759
but Immense Knowledge
isn't just an ordinary buffalo.

00:03:56.080 --> 00:03:58.919
He is the messenger
of the natural spirits.

00:03:59.759 --> 00:04:03.479
Grand Dragon watches the movement
of his eyes, his ears,

00:04:03.559 --> 00:04:06.320
and the way his horns
rock from side to side.

00:04:07.119 --> 00:04:11.240
He reads through hoofprints
that Immense Knowledge leaves behind him.

00:04:20.079 --> 00:04:23.040
There have been seers, from father to son,

00:04:23.119 --> 00:04:26.720
in Grand Dragon's family
for 58 generations,

00:04:26.799 --> 00:04:29.079
and always with the same buffalos.

00:04:35.959 --> 00:04:38.440
Rice is the center of the Hani's life.

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:41.640
Every family owns about 100 small plots

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:44.679
within a radius
of nine miles of the village.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:47.600
Usually, they are passed down
through the family.

00:04:48.320 --> 00:04:51.000
Sometimes they lose track
of who owns what,

00:04:51.079 --> 00:04:53.720
so they come to Grand Dragon.

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:15.440
The paddies are watched constantly,
they must never dry up.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:16.839
In one year alone,

00:05:16.920 --> 00:05:20.440
they are plowed five times
and raked four times.

00:05:21.119 --> 00:05:23.160
The right moment has to be chosen.

00:05:24.119 --> 00:05:27.679
For that, they always ask
for Grand Dragon's advice.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:32.559
He has to climb up to some paddies
and down to others.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:35.119
He listens and advises.

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.160
Some evenings,
his legs are numb from fatigue.

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:59.519
Below in the valley,
part of the harvest is used for barter.

00:05:59.839 --> 00:06:01.399
The rest feeds the people.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:04.399
Depending on the altitude,

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:07.679
the quality of the soil,
and the exposure to the sun,

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:10.720
13 varieties of rice are grown,

00:06:11.079 --> 00:06:13.839
three of which are the sticky variety.

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:18.079
They are always afraid
of making a mistake,

00:06:18.279 --> 00:06:22.200
so they ask Grand Dragon, of course.

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:40.760
[Hani spoken audio].

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:13.440
There are never any windows
in the dwellings.

00:07:13.519 --> 00:07:15.959
The smoke is supposed to stay inside.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:22.279
It keeps insects and rodents away
and protects the rice stored in the lofts.

00:07:31.119 --> 00:07:35.160
Grand Dragon has asked the wind,
the clouds and the springs.

00:07:35.679 --> 00:07:40.279
The Yellow Mountain
must be sculpted at the next moon.

00:07:41.119 --> 00:07:44.720
He must now begin
preparing the major project.

00:07:44.959 --> 00:07:46.839
His mission begins tomorrow.

00:07:55.679 --> 00:07:58.679
[Hani spoken audio].

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:16.719
To begin with, water has to be found.

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:20.119
In this area,
springs are found on mountaintops.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:23.400
The waterkeeper protects the springs.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:26.919
She alone knows
the underground pathways of the water

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:28.840
for irrigating the new mountain.

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:31.960
[Hani spoken audio].

00:10:04.919 --> 00:10:06.799
A buffalo's hide is fragile.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.039
It must always be kept damp.

00:10:09.599 --> 00:10:12.559
Otherwise, it cracks
and the buffalo goes crazy.

00:10:14.799 --> 00:10:17.799
[Hani spoken audio]

00:10:50.239 --> 00:10:55.000
Next, Grand Dragon has to convince
the Yi tribe to take part in the work.

00:10:55.919 --> 00:11:01.280
According to ritual,
he visits Old Tiger, the Yi's sorcerer.

00:11:01.359 --> 00:11:04.359
[Hani spoken audio].

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:21.440
The Yellow Mountain will be sculpted
halfway up the northern slope,

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:25.119
which makes it midway
between the two villages.

00:12:25.400 --> 00:12:28.400
[Hani spoken audio].

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:36.559
The Hanis and the Yis
use the mountain echoes

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:37.880
to spread the news.

00:12:38.119 --> 00:12:40.679
In a few hours,
all the villagers will know

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:43.359
where and when the work is to begin.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:50.640
[Hani spoken audio].

00:13:31.799 --> 00:13:36.880
The time has come for Grand Dragon
to withdraw and consult his ancestors,

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:40.159
and go back in time
to the very first sorcerer

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:44.479
to remember the first mountain
and call up the strength

00:13:44.599 --> 00:13:46.440
that led to it being sculpted.

00:13:49.679 --> 00:13:53.239
Meanwhile, another Grand Dragon
takes his place in the village.

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:38.320
The great day arrives.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:41.400
Grand Dragon expels the evil spirits.

00:14:41.559 --> 00:14:43.280
The village has to be cleaned.

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:55.440
Evil spirits have infiltrated everywhere,
the streets and the lofts.

00:14:55.719 --> 00:14:57.320
They must be chased away.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:39.520
[Hani spoken audio].

00:15:54.039 --> 00:15:57.919
The Yi consider that vivid colors
suit their women best.

00:15:58.479 --> 00:15:59.520
As for the Hani,

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:02.159
they think their women
are too beautiful already,

00:16:02.239 --> 00:16:04.559
so they dress them in dark colors.

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.200
For the great day,

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:09.880
they forget their differences
and like the very first time,

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.200
sculpt the mountains together.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.719
So goes the tradition.

00:16:22.719 --> 00:16:25.719
[Hani spoken audio].

00:19:41.119 --> 00:19:45.160
The new rice paddies
will be shared by the two communities.

00:19:46.079 --> 00:19:47.520
The Feast of the Long Table

00:19:47.599 --> 00:19:50.839
signals the beginning
of a new monsoon season.

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:53.760
It will be followed by other ceremonies.

00:19:54.599 --> 00:19:58.920
The awakening of the insects,
the swings, the new rice,

00:19:59.839 --> 00:20:02.599
and each time,
Grand Dragon will have to say

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:05.719
what there is to do
and when it must be done.

00:20:07.800 --> 00:20:10.000
Mountain Sculptors are like that.

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:13.239
They love celebrations and rice alcohol.

00:20:14.199 --> 00:20:17.199
[Hani spoken audio].

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:48.239
Grand Dragon's mission is nearly over.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:51.079
Now, he must thank the forces of nature,

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.959
those that will protect
the Yellow Mountain.

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:59.760
For that, he has to plow 12 rice paddies
with his buffalo, Immense Knowledge.

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:03.800
Twelve paddies are offered to nature.

00:21:04.439 --> 00:21:05.680
One for the wind,

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:07.560
one for the mountain,

00:21:07.839 --> 00:21:09.560
one for the clouds,

00:21:09.640 --> 00:21:11.199
one for the springs…

00:22:01.199 --> 00:22:05.000
The day will come when Grand Dragon's son
will take his place.

00:22:05.400 --> 00:22:11.000
As ever, it will be his job
to protect the mountains and rice paddies.

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:14.280
[Hani spoken audio].

